/- === Totality declares (arc 3 sweep, 2026-08-18, final batch): Lean-target only.
   Fuel cases (fuelExhausted witness panics at runtime, typing only):
   pull_constrained recurses with n+1 through the self/wrap closures --
   automatic rejected (no decreasing measure) -> witness the input pexpr g;
   step_eval_pexpr recurses with a rewritten pexpr (PElet/PEcase steps) and
   under mapM helpers -- automatic rejected (no decreasing measure);
   eval_pexpr_aux2 is a step-until-value loop on rewritten pexprs ->
   witness Result (Undef ...).
   Previously parked (resolved below): eval_pexpr_aux_broken -- same loop shape, needs
   fuel, but its lem body starts with `step_eval_pexpr ... >>= ...` on a
   fresh line and the backend's fuel wrapper leaves the rewritten bind head
   alone on its line with argument lines at column 3, escaping the
   `| Nat.succ lemFuel =>` match arm (Lean: `Type mismatch
